  "notes": [
    "Discrepancy (selection_foreground): extras/alacritty lotus uses #dcd7ba, extras/kitty #43436c. Kept kitty: #dcd7ba on the #c9cbd1 selection would be ~1.1:1.",
    "In Lotus ui.fg_dim (lotusInk2) is darker, i.e. higher contrast, than ui.fg: fg.muted follows the spec and is distinguished from fg.default by hue, not by lightness.",
    "ansi16 overrides (hue-aware nearest slot that clears the contract floor; dim modelled as 55% blend): status.info -> '0' (slot 6 is 3.88:1; slot 0 = #1f1f28, 13.62:1) | accent.secondary -> '13' (slot 13 is the closer match to #624c83; slot 13 = #624c83, 6.07:1) | mark -> '13' (slot 13 is the closer match to #624c83; slot 13 = #624c83, 6.07:1) | fg.muted -> '7' (default 'default dim' resolves to 2.41:1; now 6.19:1) | fg.faint -> '7' (default '8' resolves to 2.93:1; now 6.19:1) | keyhint.desc -> '7' (default 'default dim' resolves to 2.41:1; now 6.19:1) | tab.inactive.fg -> '7' (default 'default dim' resolves to 2.41:1; now 6.19:1) | tab.active.bg -> '10', tab.active.fg -> 'bg bold' (the theme draws a filled active tab: #4d699b on #e4d794)"
  ]
}
